llo Rabaneda R is an author who contributed to the guidelines on home artificial nutrition for oncological patients", "MATEO LOBO R:Mateo Lobo R is an author who contributed to the guidelines on home artificial nutrition for oncological patients", "ATENCIÓN ESPECIALIZADA:Specialized care services that collaborate in the management of patients receiving home artificial nutrition", "NAD:NAD refers to nutritional support provided at home, specifically focusing on artificial nutrition administered in a home setting. This approach is being compared to standard treatment regarding its cost-effectiveness and the benefits it offers. Additionally, NAD has been studied in relation to the quality of life of both patients receiving this form of nutrition and their caregivers, highlighting its significance in improving overall well-being in a home care context.", "QOL-EF:El QOL-EF es un cuestionario específico para evaluar la calidad de vida en pacientes con cáncer de cabeza y cuello que reciben nutrición enteral.", "NUTRIQOL:NutriQoL es un cuestionario que valora la calidad de vida en pacientes con nutrición enteral, independientemente de la vía de administración y la enfermedad.", "HIDRATACIÓN ARTIFICIAL:La hidratación artificial es un tema controvertido en el cuidado de pacientes al final de la vida, y su uso no siempre es recomendado.", "EORTC-QLQ-C30:EORTC-QLQ-C30 is a quality of life assessment tool used in cancer patients to measure the impact of treatments on their well-being.", "NIÑOS CON NED:Children receiving NED are young patients who require nutritional support, with their caregivers experiencing psychological effects.", "SÍNDROME DEL CUIDADOR «QUEMADO»:Caregiver burnout syndrome is a condition characterized by physical, emotional, and mental exhaustion experienced by caregivers."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}